 <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit Details</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Minimum Age : <b>Course Wise.</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Maximum Age : <b>Course Wise.</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.9317%; height: 36px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>MMM University of Technology Admission 2026 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Course Details</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 49.5392%;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Course Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 25px; width: 50.3925%;\" colspan=\"3\"><strong>MMM University of Technology Eligibility Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 85px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 49.5392%; height: 85px;\" colspan=\"2\">B Tech All Branches (Through JEE MAIN)</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50.3925%; height: 85px;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">10+2 Passed from any Recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">JEE MAIN 2026.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">More Details Read The Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 25px; width: 99.9317%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>MMM University of Technology Admission 2026 : Total 1189 Seats</strong></span></h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.4589%; text-align: center;\"><strong>MMM University of Technology Branches Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.5411%; text-align: center;\"><strong>MMM University of Technology Total Seats</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.4589%; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;Civil Engineering (CE)</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.5411%; text-a