iew and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 62px; text-align: center; width: 99.9317%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.9317%; text-align: center; height: 146px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.5392%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3925%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.9317%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 37px; width: 49.5392%;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 37px; width: 50.3925%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2><strong><a title=\"MMMUT Apply Online 2026\" href=\"https://mmmutadm.samarth.edu.in/2026/index.php/registration/user-new/register\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 49.5392%; height: 55px;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Candidate Login</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50.3925%; height: 55px;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2><a title=\"MMMUT Admissions Login 2026\" href=\"https://mmmutadm.samarth.edu.in/2026/index.php/site/