ssion Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>20 June 2026..</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>6. What is the Apply with Late Fee Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can apply with Late Fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">20 June 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>7. How can I apply for JRD State University Chitrakoot Admission Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_23733\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-23733\" style=\"width: 1480px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-23733\" title=\"MMMUT UG Admissions\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201490%20983'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"MMMUT Admissions 2026 \" width=\"1490\" height=\"983\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MMMUT-2026-Admissions.jpg 1490w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MMMUT-2026-Admissions-300x198.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MMMUT-2026-Admissions-1024x676.jpg 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MMMUT-2026-Admissions-768x507.jpg 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"